      "content": "but it's not that simple. i see it happening every single day. the way people look at me, the way i feel inside... it's all just the same pattern. and honestly, if i'm the one who stops it, isn't that more noble than just letting it play out until it destroys someone else? like, wouldn't it be better if the line just ended with me so no one else has to suffer through this legacy? it feels like the only way to actually protect people is to make sure there's nothing left to pass on.",
